text:
Refactor the following code to optimize it for speed and ease of use. def check_prime(num):
    for n in range(2, num):
        if num % n == 0:
            return False
    return True

Describe the overall purpose of the code snippet. def quick_sort(arr): 
    if len(arr) <= 1: 
        return arr 
    else: 
        return quick_sort([x for x in arr[1:] if x < arr[0]]) + [arr[0]] + quick_sort([x for x in arr[1:] if x >= arr[0]])

